WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.690 --> 00:00:02.780
- You look, this is, oh!

00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:03.613
- This is all -

00:00:03.613 --> 00:00:05.392
- [Kelly] This is my childhood.

00:00:05.392 --> 00:00:07.420
- Everyone who worked on this show,

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:10.200
your wardrobe team got this together

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.010
with a day or two notice.

00:00:12.010 --> 00:00:12.843
They're amazing.

00:00:12.843 --> 00:00:14.061
- You know why?

00:00:14.061 --> 00:00:15.093
(audience clapping)

00:00:15.093 --> 00:00:15.952
- They're amazing, yes!

00:00:15.952 --> 00:00:16.785
- If you don't know this-

00:00:16.785 --> 00:00:17.740
We're dressing for the eighties today.

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:19.540
And this is literally

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:21.780
top three characters of all time for me.

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:22.707
Especially for my childhood.

00:00:22.707 --> 00:00:24.400
"Labyrinth's" David Bowie.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:25.574
It was amazing.

00:00:25.574 --> 00:00:26.407
(audience clapping)

00:00:26.407 --> 00:00:28.460
- They mentioned that this
is your favorite movie.

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:30.200
Well, first of all, this is how I dress

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:31.033
- First of all. (laughs)

00:00:31.033 --> 00:00:33.360
- I was like, "What's 'Labyrinth'?"

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:34.552
This is me.

00:00:34.552 --> 00:00:35.550
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:36.600
- It's just a Monday.

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:40.170
- It's really all about the eyebrows.

00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:41.450
- It's the pointy eyebrows.

00:00:41.450 --> 00:00:42.560
- [Kelly] It's amazing.

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:43.930
I mean, you're about to just break out

00:00:43.930 --> 00:00:45.510
and babe with the power,
it's gonna be amazing.

00:00:45.510 --> 00:00:46.910
Did you love the movie as well?

00:00:46.910 --> 00:00:47.743
- I did.

00:00:47.743 --> 00:00:48.700
I remember the first time I saw it

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:51.840
and I was titillated and disturbed.

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:55.550
- Cause it's like, with
Toby, they're kind of scary.

00:00:55.550 --> 00:00:57.590
A lot of it, it's very scary.

00:00:57.590 --> 00:00:58.640
- They're horrifying.

00:00:59.630 --> 00:01:01.670
It's what I love about Henson.

00:01:01.670 --> 00:01:04.630
Henson doesn't talk down,
never talk down to kids.

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:06.760
They always assume the best of children

00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:09.190
even when they're making terrifying stuff.

00:01:09.190 --> 00:01:10.023
- Yeah!

00:01:10.023 --> 00:01:10.856
And so I was terrified.

00:01:10.856 --> 00:01:12.827
And then you see David Bowie in that movie

00:01:12.827 --> 00:01:16.050
and I was a kid and I was
like, "What am I feeling here?

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:17.754
I'm feeling something."

00:01:17.754 --> 00:01:19.290
- What was he feeling there?

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:20.740
Because his pants were tight!

00:01:22.234 --> 00:01:25.250
- Do we think that was him
or was that like a cup?

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:26.811
We'll talk about it.

00:01:26.811 --> 00:01:28.940
- I'm just saying, for
a child, you were like

00:01:28.940 --> 00:01:31.096
it looks like a wrestler.

00:01:31.096 --> 00:01:33.390
It looked like a lot happening down there.

00:01:33.390 --> 00:01:36.024
- It definitely confused me.

00:01:36.024 --> 00:01:38.247
I looked at that big bulge and I was like,

00:01:38.247 --> 00:01:41.120
"Wait, what is the male anatomy then?"

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:42.600
- Why don't I have that?

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:44.545
- Is it one circle?

00:01:44.545 --> 00:01:46.130
(audience laughing)

00:01:46.130 --> 00:01:47.380
- [Kelly] It was amazing.

